{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41393","headline":"感怀诗二章 一 · 韩熙载","name":"感怀诗二章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仆本江北人，今作江南客。\n再去江北游，举目无相识。\n金风吹我寒，秋月爲谁白。\n不如归去来，江南有人忆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩熙载","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}